# Features

1. Character Creation
   - Enter player name
   - Choose character class
   - Choose a Skin (male/female/magician/wolf)

2. Story System
   - Interactive storytelling
   - Multiple dialogue options
   - Different story paths

3. Combat System
   - Turn-based combat (Like in Pokemon)
   - Enemy encounters based on actions
   - Health and damage calculation

4. Inventory System
   - Collect items
   - Use healing potions
   - Equip weapons

5. Economy System
   - Earn gold
   - Buy items from merchants

6. Quest System
   - Main quests
   - Side quests

7. Save System
   - Save game progress
   - Load previous games

8. Multiple Endings
   - Different endings based on player choices 
